    {
      "title": "Barger To Have Season Ending Elbow Surgery",
      "summary": "I remember, when I was young and playing sports, the parents, who we called coaches, said \u2018give 110%\u2019. Well, you can\u2019t/shouldn\u2019t do it all the time. You go all out, you are likely to injury something, Addison Barger is going to have season ending elbow surgery. He\u2019ll either have Tommy John or an internal brace [&#8230;]",
