    {
      "title": "Friday Open Thread",
      "summary": "I\u2019ve been trying to do one of these open threads once a week, generally on off-days, but we don\u2019t have an off-day this week. And we get to play the very hot Boston Red Sox this weekend. Tonight\u2019s game is one of those fun Apple TV games, because MLB will do anything for a dollar. [&#8230;]",
